Hi all,

It's already 7 months since i2c-tools 3.0.1 was released, and there are
quite a few interesting changes in the SVN repository. In particular,
the following changes are worth underlining:

* Improved error handling (all tools)
* Support for i2c bus passed by name (all tools)
* Compatibility fix for perl 5.10.0 (decode-dimms)

Proposed schedule:

* November 23rd: SVN freeze
* November 24th to 27th: testing
* November 28th: release

